#: scenario5:scenario5_7F9C6881_0D0B_448C_963B_E47E326BBE54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b23826b1be837ad8d814dbfa63cc839b391a1aad5fe22f0f81ecedc3a4bbb0b5
#. default-sha256: 2ae6cd55d4aa112cd6ed837dd0e8124a8d390830ce424947f25f706efb4ec809
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7F9C6881_0D0B_448C_963B_E47E326BBE54"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫It had been a little under "
"two weeks since I had moved in with Michel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫미셸과 함께 산 지 ⟪k:14⟫"
"대략 열흘이 지났다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A2B2C3A3_E67B_4632_A11A_A01A64AC1CB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e2dbe7cd5c3e7a36f2cadb87628425f211e0136f9883a02f0b9ce10f792bdd7
#. default-sha256: d5213e07eb6a405b1107ad70820dd9ec3149dd1c7b7c0910775854c450bee0e2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A2B2C3A3_E67B_4632_A11A_A01A64AC1CB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though we lived in the same house, we rarely saw each other."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫말이 함께지, ⟪k:1⟫얼굴을 볼 ⟪k:2⟫기회도 많지 않아서――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2A965A44_8F80_40BF_A5E1_D86B24CE088C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5d5b7bc7111eccc4e8cdb22938f94f1653fccc77678276009ab5fbf15d4ac3e
#. default-sha256: a59e0431356a3a8ea2a894229372ae7ad7dd209834481490feea89ffade97c88
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2A965A44_8F80_40BF_A5E1_D86B24CE088C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫On unlucky days, I wouldn’t see him at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫심하면 ⟪k:1⟫하루 종일 못 보기도 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_85E8BFB9_F381_4DD1_BD7C_4527A9E775B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15fdeb4e72ddeb7bd925c136db89ddebe32d47e341a067e51a1ed7de41170593
#. default-sha256: eb3df87c5005c79b021fcd2ca91d5c965873772fdaed826ea9f7065ed04e6208
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_85E8BFB9_F381_4DD1_BD7C_4527A9E775B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure if he ate in his room or our schedules were simply misaligned, but we never "
"had any meals together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫식사도 일부러 시간을 다르게 잡는 건지, ⟪k:1⟫방에서 먹는 건진 모르겠지만, ⟪k:2⟫아무튼 겸상한 "
"적도 없었으니……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A5BCFB35_20B8_4F12_9B50_57F5C20CAF1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07f5d33934a6eebfd2fb7e1378350c390b298cecc3924d10bfc910b5eba19512
#. default-sha256: 9f0189e41718d509eaf601337deea64a321c20b8f2f4dae3ea662f0c5721051d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A5BCFB35_20B8_4F12_9B50_57F5C20CAF1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Perhaps he was deliberately avoiding me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어쩌면 ⟪k:1⟫의도적으로 나랑 접하지 않으려는 걸 수도 있겠다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CBF3FE2B_D765_47F6_BB1B_2ECF64E875C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87458a02ea20fae307d3abae5bb62d95266d491d8cc88292b6a59c04164cc940
#. default-sha256: 71e77778ba17ce76a4c67d6a653bf6a842b46761b1f462b5027aa2ea9d553fa2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CBF3FE2B_D765_47F6_BB1B_2ECF64E875C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That has to be it..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫역시 ⟪k:1⟫피하는 걸까……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8C1E720E_D5B5_4FCD_86BC_ACBADC321ACB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7f83a92914e04842935aa0c4d9a307f487d3b12b0a357817ddbefd6ce655492
#. default-sha256: 99391f78d4ffd68ff1f3a2e9b49e089c664202ff6080a19a4af287e18dfb8f91
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8C1E720E_D5B5_4FCD_86BC_ACBADC321ACB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I know servant and master don’t usually eat at the same table,⟪k:1⟫but even so..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저택 주인과 고용인이란 입장이니, ⟪k:1⟫물론 ⟪k:2⟫겸상을 하지야 않겠는데……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6CBD4980_1912_4BFE_B443_1D7A16551157
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a028f9f7c86c68c5e9203cdd0988e3d382465dced1ace0f3a16c27ff81e570b5
#. default-sha256: 3a45f524ff62c36d618edd5ca2c67f2f3b03b263bce28d5fcb9c0b40a1633829
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6CBD4980_1912_4BFE_B443_1D7A16551157"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He could be a little less obvious about it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이렇게 대놓고 ⟪k:1⟫피할 것까진 없지 않나."

#: scenario5:scenario5_EA9C66EA_A57E_400D_A70B_91B4F80816DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EA9C66EA_A57E_400D_A70B_91B4F80816DA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5B8E17F4_A3C4_419A_A00C_994A0502EBCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6b3c33b2eb6a3b8b15a7ecf1f8548084ef7c6a9e5e5b6504494819a7debd4da
#. default-sha256: 4e9ff0d66a95494a9e316e6211f1370688d5c080c6c82964930554d060cf4063
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5B8E17F4_A3C4_419A_A00C_994A0502EBCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Am I really that much of a nuisance?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇게 ⟪k:1⟫거치적거리나……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BA276AAF_86AF_4D04_9849_50FCA2D525C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6223898a9777101ee9520c5009ae0789c2445c56475a515495371ad10dc18f5d
#. default-sha256: 994c9275e1021fb8ef82654756870acedcbe3c87c4984ffcb2c270648aacc640
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BA276AAF_86AF_4D04_9849_50FCA2D525C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m not doing anything inappropriate, am I?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m being pleasant and sociable, aren’t "
"I?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내가 ⟪k:1⟫뭐 잘못한 건 없지……? ⟪k:2⟫밝게 접했지?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DF3F6E2A_FF8E_4D95_805F_7A18C50830D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 676f7f0d15db4ac11bdaa988cb4d553c0c081465eb591de04c171a8bf9bf43c3
#. default-sha256: 5ae4f37dd38e81100a4bc420ebd3ce25cde66e14abfb20b4d041d34026370bb9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DF3F6E2A_FF8E_4D95_805F_7A18C50830D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I haven’t given him any reason to not like me, I think.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I hope..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫밉보일 이유가 ⟪k:1⟫없을 텐데………… 그럴 거라 믿고 싶은데."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C945864B_F126_41CF_AB15_A799D69A1064
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 992c9930309968b0ac0f71c1f00997491d7f3fa92049bfd962fb75477eebc8f2
#. default-sha256: 346f4f47fe82365920f0830ab213257838a60e76681736264e08d22e7ed17cf4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C945864B_F126_41CF_AB15_A799D69A1064"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had never been very enthusiastic about my staying here,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하긴 ⟪k:1⟫처음 만났을 때부터⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내가 여기서 지내는 걸 달갑게 여기는 눈치는 아니었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BA31EB28_082D_47A3_BB1A_CF08485A11A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d54fb9c522a92cc4fa31637b7f020a5c15eaff629e27aab615d683e85a3fc514
#. default-sha256: 035ac979531a565cdf8d62daff05393c61d94573e77f90662a986d824eb79466
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BA31EB28_082D_47A3_BB1A_CF08485A11A3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but I hadn’t been given a choice. ⟪k:1⟫I had been sent here by his family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 나도 ⟪k:1⟫여기 가라고――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 사람 친가에서 지시받은 입장이라……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_285A114B_CE40_48E8_A101_D05970835748
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1709af24a456e4267f8b5d9a03ba6ec601493340c6f9e8a47129038d6b261b6f
#. default-sha256: b94d221a85edc076c2272ca0c908b9624bf539691e1d74bb0e1f7eaa711d250b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_285A114B_CE40_48E8_A101_D05970835748"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Besides..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫더구나………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8A74422A_EB14_4C1B_9C52_8A4D968F7929
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8A74422A_EB14_4C1B_9C52_8A4D968F7929"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A5ABC44B_1465_43F4_850E_1343EF233D08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ecb5854cbeff662efc627aa6206c244046a5ffbe7afa625a03abed4c726cf11
#. default-sha256: bf7edc8cea4361c45848a1da297fed7b507f5d9859642670c6801ec75e1ccc18
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A5ABC44B_1465_43F4_850E_1343EF233D08"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No. Out with the negative thoughts. ⟪k:1⟫Gotta stay positive.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Yeah! He hasn’t tried "
"to chase me out yet."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫부정적으로 생각하면 안 돼. ⟪k:1⟫긍정적으로 굴자.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫맞아! ⟪k:4⟫나가라고 면박 준 것도 아"
"니잖아."

#: scenario5:scenario5_51CB0B3F_6BE5_4FF3_8496_E69F74237C28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d17b0f0baf81d57af16fcfac1abddcb460fbb0a6965a18bde4bdbfd76502efc
#. default-sha256: f40701389469af147927d89204df8decd8648d736b198d5fbd7a5a6dabd4ce2a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_51CB0B3F_6BE5_4FF3_8496_E69F74237C28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just... ⟪k:1⟫haven’t broken the ice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아직…… ⟪k:1⟫친해지지 못 해서 그런 거야."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F0A004FE_0504_4874_863A_BDC4B1385474
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b44c572b47e1d30042821cb8f7de54a23d0b38345289bef377ab15f5bd6b4e5
#. default-sha256: 815e683ca13e4401339ed3acedeedf33717706127f02ecc07e06caf0eefda30d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F0A004FE_0504_4874_863A_BDC4B1385474"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had to stay positive. ⟪k:1⟫Optimistic. ⟪k:2⟫Happy thoughts. ⟪k:3⟫And be myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……그렇다. ⟪k:1⟫긍정적으로 ⟪k:2⟫해 나가야 한다. ⟪k:3⟫긍정, ⟪k:4⟫긍정.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫나답게, ⟪k:7⟫밝"
"게."

#: scenario5:scenario5_17E15F6A_C5C3_484C_AD9B_E119F8B8A747
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 604587b1a6ee73784709687d7588578ab5778b964293b7abedb0b8c083e2d3a6
#. default-sha256: 6fa8de6a019d618528451518b4f7b8a1462149e8f2521e482d9119483f591b93
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_17E15F6A_C5C3_484C_AD9B_E119F8B8A747"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As long as I kept working at it, with enough time, Michel would surely come around and not "
"be so distant."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫시간을 들이다 보면 ⟪k:1⟫미셸도 멀쩡히 접해 줄 것이다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그러니 ⟪k:4⟫힘내자……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_53CFEAC8_81FA_438F_89DC_E760DAC769D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35aea6d5e875058343b92d44409e694afa590667f929ea72a2cbab61fec51a66
#. default-sha256: 4d66e96b7c9e7b069891166efa66054847a0bb2f8a27c5e0b76a2f8b5f2da226
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_53CFEAC8_81FA_438F_89DC_E760DAC769D9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ve got a goal, so let’s get to work!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫First, I make supper, then I ask him to have "
"it with me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그럼 어디!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫저녁 식사 준비를 해서 ⟪k:3⟫오늘은 꼭 같이 먹자고 해 봐야지!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7BF7B634_FCB5_4F5B_AF9C_9DD60B9B5647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25b8d06ffcf5a058906ba30f542bfd8f461071fc0cecfcbd9aec7f1575d0a9e1
#. default-sha256: 23cc0e89cf9736cc686d20b0b69792205e899e3f2f3f7185e94a4d4303b60721
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7BF7B634_FCB5_4F5B_AF9C_9DD60B9B5647"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Gotta be proactive when it comes to the reclusive types.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All right, here goes!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런 음습~한 타입한텐 ⟪k:1⟫내가 먼저 다가가야 해. ⟪k:2⟫좋아, ⟪k:3⟫친해지자!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1833A9EF_9C5F_42E2_A025_321232DDA47F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56694ba23d5319e8f91679240bb60579eb768e551e457b4929f5e8735c1d391d
#. default-sha256: e3572cc83fc188e4c49f678e6d9d9eee24da2e7764fa1c761dcc306315bd9e1c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1833A9EF_9C5F_42E2_A025_321232DDA47F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Or, here ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ go..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………말은 ⟪k:1⟫그래도."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B72CDCC4_4A01_424F_85BE_6835A62DB5E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8060fac96e3311ce2cce22086e3cc28931c2c1b4f0377659e04adf805370cd54
#. default-sha256: b9b28ed7dac052964a3b4b2903e29657a11bf5a33cc65fd298b8ff644995b68d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B72CDCC4_4A01_424F_85BE_6835A62DB5E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but we’re almost out of supplies."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫슬슬 ⟪k:1⟫식량이 떨어지려 하는데."

#: scenario5:scenario5_11BB8136_F92F_4ACC_9734_9C23776BACCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7024a9ab7b86d00bfc7f6008d9389e5cd544d9594910f719bca5d93a9c1a6c4
#. default-sha256: a5bee4990db3d0980d41713b088806fc45a31f5877d0c5ce49d8bac5f7ac546c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_11BB8136_F92F_4ACC_9734_9C23776BACCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Well, so much for that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………난감하네."

#: scenario5:scenario5_412A536C_C679_4625_A4B3_6C6F04C86EBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d1bd7604f1fbedca156ba4a3490c98c0be94b6a35b82cd05ced68c36c532e8f
#. default-sha256: f7aee8cf80e803c9ce9e1917eed20c80c760b28606d3b8d032024f7954a16d7a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_412A536C_C679_4625_A4B3_6C6F04C86EBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where the nonperishable food was stored. ⟪k:1⟫Dried foods, smoked meats, "
"cheeses, and a small scattering of root vegetables."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫지하창고에는 ⟪k:1⟫오래 가는 식량이 보존되어 있었다. ⟪k:2⟫훈제, ⟪k:3⟫건조식품, ⟪k:4⟫치즈. "
"⟪k:5⟫또 뿌리채소가 조금."

